<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills July 21.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills July 21.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge ($8 million) of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on July 21, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K2201981</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 21</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Jan 22, 1998</p>
<p>($1 = 75.2005 tenge)</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410 ($ = 75.2 Kazakhstan Tenge)</p>
